<h1>Subscribe to Daisy</h1>
<img align="left" src="https://i.imgur.com/dAQRaWt.jpeg" style="width:33%; margin-right: 10px;" class="rounded" alt="Subscribe to Daisy"></img>

<b>Perks for following me:</b>
<ul class="article-content">
<li>Access my library of high resolution, high quality still photos, videos and audio securely visible to you with Lotte Harper.</li>
<li>Access other content from Lotte Harper, including books, games, samples, and exclusive blog posts.</li>
<li>Call my phone and listen to interactive audio on the phone.</li>
<li>Send me text messages and text for a photo or status.</li>
<li>Would you like something else? Just ask me! We can talk about implementing your custom request.</li>
</ul>

<p> - Daisy</p>
