<h1>{{ site_name }} - See what's new in your next visit</h1>
<p>Dear {{ user.username }},</p>
<p>I'm inviting you back to see what's new on {{ site_name }}. I'd love to see you there!</p>
{% if videos %}
<i>Watch these new videos on my YouTube</i>
{% for video in videos %}
<a href="{{ video.get_youtube_url }}" title="Watch this video on YouTube">
<div>{{ video.title }}</div>
<img style="width: 60%; max-width: 300px;" src="{{ video.thumbnail_url }}">
</a>
